window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Harlow Howl has made a career out of styling monsters and crafting a world of beauty and glam. Despite her stylish ways, no amount of makeup can cover up the truth she's been hiding from her monster friends. A deadly sickness is severing her bond with the inner wolf and threatening a relationship with a bigfoot she believes is her mate. As time is running out, the only chance she has for survival lies within the sacred rituals of his reclusive Bigfoot clan with a people who guard their secrets as fiercely as their territory.</p> <p>Bearington Pinecrest has spent his life standing between reclusive country living and turning wrenches at Gigi’s Garage as head pit crew mechanic. A single dad and the next tribal chief, Bear's path to leadership was easy: obey the rules, keep the bloodline pure, and never date a werewolf. When a pink-furred beauty walked into his life, the latter wasn't as simple as he planned.</p> <p>To save the were-woman he loves, Bear must break tradition and defy his elders by uncovering a tribal secret that was never meant to be revealed. With his twin brother by his side, a feral toddler in tow, and the fearless friends from Ghouls and Gals Plaza supporting him, he is prepared to fight. He'll risk it all for a brighter future for a stubborn Sasquatch community and the were-woman he's grown to love.</p>"; 
